  Note: edge-case N=5 — still too small to quote externally.
        That dataset is stacked toward the Critic's known failure modes
        (over-firing on hedged/partial answers), so it measures edge-case
        precision, not overall Critic quality in production.
        The generated set measures the opposite end: whether obvious
        degradations are caught at all.
        Reproducibility depends on the MODEL, not just the config: the critic
        asks for temperature=0, but a model that rejects it (gpt-5.6-luna and
        the reasoning family) is silently served at its default and verdicts
        will move between runs. Check the logs for
        openai_rejected_temperature_retrying_without before trusting a delta.
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
